ng Normal Attacks. An excellent 5-star alternative, just behind Cashflow Supervision."},{"name":"The Widsith","text":"Provides 55.1% CRIT DMG and, at R5, grants a random 10-second buff: 120% ATK, 96% Elemental DMG Bonus, or 480 EM. A strong 4-star option for Wriothesley, especially at high refinements, though its random passive makes performance inconsistent"},{"name":"Ballad of the Boundless Blue","text":"Provides 30.6% Energy Recharge and, at R5, grants up to 48% Normal Attack DMG and 36% Charged Attack DMG after hitting enemies. A solid F2P option for Wriothesley, especially if he needs extra Energy Recharge."},{"name":"Mappa Mare","text":"Craftable Elemental Mastery choice; triggering Melt reliably procs its Elemental DMG Bonus."}],"a":[{"names":["Disenchantment in Deep Shadow"],"text":"Provides 18% ATK and boosts Stellar-Conduct DMG by 40%, with 16% CRIT Rate against affected enemies. Wriothesley’s best-in-slot set for Stellar-Conduct teams, though Marechaussee Hunter remains strong for his other playstyles.","stats":"ATK% - ATK% - CR / CD J"},{"names":["Marechaussee Hunter"],"text":"Provides 15% Normal and Charged Attack DMG and up to 36% CRIT Rate when HP fluctuates. Wriothesley’s best-in-slot set for traditional Freeze and Melt teams, with excellent synergy from his HP mechanics.","stats":""},{"names":["Blizzard Strayer"],"text":"Provides 15% Cryo DMG and up to 40% CRIT Rate against Cryo-affected or Frozen enemies. A strong option for Freeze teams, but Wriothesley’s Charged Attacks can Shatter enemies and reduce Freeze uptime. Marechaussee Hunter is generally more flexible","stats":""}],"t":[{"name":"Conducted Chaos","members":["Wriothesley","Odette","Mitya","Nicole"],"text":"Wriothesley leads on-field Stellar-Conduct damage, Mitya adds off-field Electro damage, Odette enables and buffs Stellar-Conduct, and Nicole provides shielding and teamwide ATK buffs.","roles":["Main DPS","Stellar","Sub DPS","Support"]},{"name":"Freeze Frame","members":["Wriothesley","Furina","Shenhe","Escoffier"],"text":"Wriothesley leads on-field Cryo damage, Furina provides Hydro and a massive teamwide DMG Bonus, Shenhe boosts Cryo damage, and Escoffier heals while shredding Cryo/Hydro RES.","roles":["Main DPS","Buffs","Support","Support"]},{"name":"Fire Meets Frost","members":["Wriothesley","Durin","Xilonen","Nicole"],"text":"Wriothesley drives on-field Melt damage, Durin provides Pyro application, Nicole delivers teamwide ATK buffs, and Xilonen shreds Cryo/Pyro RES while boosting damage.","roles":["Main DPS","Sub DPS","Buffs","Support"]},{"name":"Frost on a Budget","members":["Wriothesley","Xiangling","Sucrose","Bennett"],"text":"Wriothesley drives Reverse Melt damage, Xiangling provides off-field Pyro, Sucrose shares EM and shreds Cryo RES, and Bennett supplies ATK buffs, healing, and Pyro energy.","roles":["Main DPS","Sub DPS","EM Build","Support"]}],"v":"","n":4},"seo":{"roles":["Main DPS"],"about":"Wriothesley is an on-field Cryo DPS who delivers powerful Normal and Charged Attacks with strong Freeze and Melt potential.","pros":["High sustained DPS","Strong Melt teams","Self-healing","Flexible teams"],"cons":["HP management","C1 preferred","Cryo resistance hurts","Wants good supports"],"weapons":["Cashflow Supervision","Tulaytullah's Remembrance","A Thousand Floating Dreams","Lost Prayer to the Sacred Winds","The Widsith","Solar Pearl","Ballad of the Boundless Blue","Mappa Mare"],"arts":[{"sets":["Disenchantment in Deep Shadow"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Main DPS"},{"sets":["Marechaussee Hunter"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Main DPS"},{"sets":["Blizzard Strayer"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Main DPS"}],"main":["ATK%","ATK% / Cryo DMG Bonus","CRIT Rate / CRIT DMG"],"stats":["Crit Rate: 60% - 70% ★ 50-65% |","Crit DMG: 170% - 230%","ATK:2,000 - 2,200+","Energy Recharge: 110% - 130%"],"vars":[],"mats":["Shivada Jade Sliver","Shivada Jade Fragment","Shivada Jade Chunk","Shivada Jade Gemstone","\"Tourbillon Device\"","Teachings of Order","Guide to Order","Philosophies of Order","Meshing Gear","Mechanical Spur Gear","Artificed Dynamic Gear","Subdetection Unit","Primordial Greenbloom","Crown of Insight","Mora","Hero's Wit"],"talents":[{"name":"Normal Attack","pri":"Level 9+"},{"name":"Elemental Skill","pri":"Level 9+"},{"name":"Elemental Burst","pri":"Level 6+"}],"teams":[{"name":"Conducted Chaos","members":["Wriothesley","Odette","Mitya","Nicole"]},{"name":"Freeze Frame","members":["Wriothesley","Furina","Shenhe","Escoffier"]},{"name":"Fire Meets Frost","members":["Wriothesley","Durin","Xilonen","Nicole"]},{"name":"Frost on a Budget","members":["Wriothesley","Xiangling","Sucrose","Bennett"]}]}}],"title":"Wriothesley","el":"Cryo"}